    "body": "> `readyState` is initialized as `complete` according to [#current-document-readiness](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#current-document-readiness) and doesn't change.\n\nI'm not sure this is true—https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-lifecycle.html#read-html:initialise-the-document-object creates a document with a current document readiness of \"loading\".",
