    "updated_at": "2026-08-08T00:33:38Z",
    "body": "Yes, you're right, I found the same path just now. It appears I was deceived by the path for loading about:blank in an existing browsing context vs. creating a new browsing context and initializing it with about:blank. In particular, it appears that steps 21-24 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#creating-a-new-browsing-context resolve my original question.",
